<title>USA: Electro-Catheter research pact terminated.</title>
<headline>Electro-Catheter research pact terminated.</headline>
<dateline>RAHWAY, N.J. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electro-Catheter Corp on Friday said its agreement in principle to perform research and development and production for a medical device company was terminated at the request of the other company.</p>
<p>A Electro-Catheter spokesman declined to identify the company. &quot;We did certain research and development work for them which was confidential in nature,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>Electro-Catheter, which makes and marketes diagnostic and therapeutic catheters and related products, said the agreement in principle had been reached in September.</p>
</text>
